  "prefLabel": "Ed 306.07 School Facilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 306.07 School Facilities. The local school board shall require that the facilities operated by the school district for K-12 educational purposes are approved to operate or are conditionally approved to operate in accordance with Ed 320.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at part heading for Ed 306) #14150, eff 12-13-24",
